WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.608 --> 00:00:11.509
One form per course. The link
has already chosen svið and term.

2
00:00:11.609 --> 00:00:16.510
Your email and kennitala –
they link the answer to you.

3
00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:21.511
Pick the course. Only your own
courses are offered.

4
00:00:21.611 --> 00:00:28.513
Núverandi drög (current draft):
the course's sessions as they stand now.

5
00:00:28.613 --> 00:00:38.178
Want a session moved, or given a time?
Leggja til breytingu (propose a change).

6
00:00:38.278 --> 00:00:44.179
It is a proposal – the office
looks at it before anything changes.

7
00:00:44.279 --> 00:00:50.179
Vikur (weeks): choose all, then
untick the ones you do not teach.

8
00:00:50.279 --> 00:00:55.180
Tímar (times): one click =
hentar vel (suits well).

9
00:00:55.280 --> 00:01:02.181
Two clicks = hentar ekki (does not suit).
Three clear it. Leave the rest blank.

10
00:01:02.281 --> 00:01:08.182
Stofur (rooms): the same clicks.
“Hentar ekki” puts a room last.

11
00:01:08.282 --> 00:01:15.183
Room not listed? Finna aðra stofu
(find another room) – search any room.

12
00:01:15.283 --> 00:01:21.184
Kennarar (teachers): tick what kind
of sessions each one teaches.

13
00:01:21.285 --> 00:01:28.315
Someone missing from Ugla?
Say so in the box below.

14
00:01:28.415 --> 00:01:33.317
Athugasemd: anything else,
in your own words.

15
00:01:33.418 --> 00:01:38.319
Yfirlit (summary): check
what will be sent.

16
00:01:38.419 --> 00:01:44.321
Senda athugasemdir (send).
You can send again – the last one counts.

17
00:01:44.421 --> 00:01:50.322
Another course? Pick it here
and fill in its form the same way.
